1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Nirbhaya.

2
00:00:47,150 --> 00:01:34,150
Disha.

3
00:01:34,300 --> 00:02:21,300
A young doctor in Kolkata.

4
00:02:21,450 --> 00:03:08,450
A schoolgirl in Raptadu.

5
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:55,600
Every time this happened, we all thought the same thing:

6
00:03:55,750 --> 00:04:42,750
This must never happen again.

7
00:04:42,900 --> 00:05:29,900
But anger alone is not enough.

8
00:05:30,050 --> 00:06:17,050
We need to bring all our ideas together.

9
00:06:17,200 --> 00:07:04,200
Better lights?

10
00:07:04,350 --> 00:07:51,350
Safe travel?

11
00:07:51,500 --> 00:08:38,500
Teaching respect at home and in school?

12
00:08:38,650 --> 00:09:25,650
Acting on the very first warning sign?

13
00:09:25,800 --> 00:10:12,800
You know your village best.

14
00:10:12,950 --> 00:10:59,950
Safety is not only the government's duty.

15
00:11:00,100 --> 00:11:47,100
It is everyone's duty.

16
00:11:47,250 --> 00:12:34,250
Open Mana Hakku, and write your idea on the Home page.

17
00:12:34,400 --> 00:13:21,400
Your idea alone is enough.

18
00:13:21,550 --> 00:14:08,550
I hope every one of you will take part.

